{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZShift","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.pentagon_drinfeld","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.pentagon_drinfeld","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L113-L169","doc":"**The pentagon in Drinfeld's coproduct form.** For four-point residues satisfying the\ninfinitesimal braid relations, with the relevant residues non-resonant,\n`Φ^{234} Φ^{1,23,4} Φ^{123} = Φ^{1,2,34} Φ^{12,3,4}`, where\n`Φ^{123} = Φ(t₁₂, t₂₃)`, `Φ^{234} = Φ(t₂₃, t₃₄)`, `Φ^{1,23,4} = Φ(t₁₂ + t₁₃, t₂₄ + t₃₄)`,\n`Φ^{1,2,34} = Φ(t₁₂, t₂₃ + t₂₄)`, `Φ^{12,3,4} = Φ(t₁₃ + t₂₃, t₃₄)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_congr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_congr","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L107-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_zero_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_zero_right","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L101-L105","doc":"**`Φ(A, 0) = 1`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_zero_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_zero_left","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L82-L99","doc":"**`Φ(0, B) = 1`** (the unitor compatibility of the associator). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_shift_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_shift_left","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L71-L80","doc":"**`Φ(A + z, B) = Φ(A, B)`** for `z` commuting with `A` and `B`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_swap_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_swap_mul","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L66-L69","doc":"Inversion for `Φ`: `Φ(B, A) Φ(A, B) = 1 = Φ(A, B) Φ(B, A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_shift_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.Φ_shift_right","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L42-L64","doc":"**`Φ(A, B + z) = Φ(A, B)`** for `z` commuting with `A` and `B`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.phiKZ_congr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.phiKZ_congr","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L35-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.binom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.binom","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L32-L33","doc":"The binomial coefficients of `(1 − t)^z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.nonResonant_kzM0_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.nonResonant_kzM0_zero","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.nonResonant_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi.nonResonant_zero","kind":"theorem","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZShiftPhi.lean#L23-L27","doc":"`0` is non-resonant. ","signatureChunk":0}]}